Package: signet
Architecture: any
Depends: adduser, ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Recommends: default-mta | mail-transport-agent
Description: web sign-in server with passwords, security keys and TOTP
 Signet signs people in to web applications with a password, a security key
 (WebAuthn), a PIN sent by mail or a TOTP code, and tells a web server or an
 application who is signed in.  Accounts are kept in a CSV file and sessions
 in SQLite.
 .
 The service is installed but not started: set cookie_secret in
 /etc/signet/config.yaml, then run "systemctl enable --now signet".
